  "nameEn": "Three Flights",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Function \"Step with a lamp\": a jump and a lamp. Function \"Flight\" calls it three times. Call \"Flight\" three times, turning right between them.",
  "descriptionEn": "Three flights of stairs: the first goes up, the second higher still, and the third goes down. A step with a lamp is the smallest brick a flight is built from.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Function \"Step with a lamp\": a jump and turn off. Function \"Flight\" calls it three times. Call \"Flight\" three times, turning right between them."
